Allure-reports
------------------
Step 1: Install Allure Pytest Plugin
    pip install allure-Pytest

Step 2: Install Allure Command-Line Tool (to view and generate reports)
    Windows : https://github.com/allure-framework/allure2/releases
    Download: https://github.com/allure-framework/allure2/releases/download/2.46.1/allure-2.46.1.zip
    Unzip and copy to drive
    Set the path variable=C:\Users\Aruna\Downloads\allure-2.46.1\allure-2.46.1\bin

Step 3: Configure Allure in pytest.ini
    [pytest]
    addopts = --alluredir=reports/allure-results

Step 4: Execute the tests
Step 5:
Only run time results
allure serve reports/allure-results

Generate permanent results
allure generate reports/allure-results -o reports/allure-reports --clean




